db-branch-proxysql (Apache-2.0) is the db-branch module that configures
ProxySQL, and depends on ProxySQL.

ProxySQL is Copyright ProxySQL LLC and contributors, licensed under the GNU
General Public License version 3 (GPL-3.0). The proxysql package in the
db-branch APT repository is the unmodified official release from
https://github.com/sysown/proxysql/releases. Its complete corresponding
source is published in the same repository, next to the binaries:

  pool/main/p/proxysql/proxysql-<version>.tar.gz

and upstream at https://github.com/sysown/proxysql.
